// Title: Suspicious Debugger Registration Cmdline
// Rule ID: ae215552-081e-44c7-805f-be16f975c8a2
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1546.008
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_registry_install_reg_debugger_backdoor.yml
